h4 How to play PhotoSYNTH
p Make music with your face and head movements, using your device’s camera.
h5 Get started
ol
	li Choose the number of players on the start screen, then select Start.
	li Allow camera access when your browser asks, and position your face in view of the camera.
	li Roll your head left and right to change the note. Tilt forwards and backwards to change the octave.
	li Open your mouth to make the sound louder. Try small movements first.
	li Tap your face on screen to choose an instrument. Explore the control panel to adjust the sound, tempo, and volume.
h5 If something is not working
ul
	li Check that your browser has permission to use the camera and that your face is well lit.
	li If there is no sound, check your device volume and the app’s volume and mute controls.
	li If loading stalls, refresh the page or try a private browsing window.
	li If a MIDI device is missing, try connecting it directly to a USB port.
